          <h2 style="font-size: var(--fs-56); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);" data-en="Everything you need to know about a 25-yard dumpster." data-es="Todo lo que necesitas saber sobre un contenedor de 25 yardas.">Everything you need to know about a 25-yard dumpster.</h2>

          <h3 data-en="What is a 25-yard roll-off dumpster?" data-es="¿Qué es un contenedor roll-off de 25 yardas?">What is a 25-yard roll-off dumpster?</h3>
          <p data-html data-en="The 25-yard is the contractor's container — the size that handles whole-house remodels, additions, and bigger commercial jobs without forcing a swap-out mid-project. Dimensions: <strong>20 feet long, 8 feet wide, and 5 feet tall</strong>, open-top with a swing-door for walk-in loading. Twenty-five cubic yards holds roughly 7.5 full-size pickup truck loads of debris." data-es="El de 25 yardas es el contenedor del contratista — el tamaño que maneja remodelaciones de casa completa, ampliaciones y trabajos comerciales más grandes sin forzar un cambio a mitad del proyecto. Dimensiones: <strong>20 pies de largo, 8 pies de ancho y 5 pies de alto</strong>, parte superior abierta con puerta abatible para carga a pie. Veinticinco yardas cúbicas contienen aproximadamente 7.5 cargas completas de camioneta de escombros.">The 25-yard is the contractor's container — the size that handles whole-house remodels, additions, and bigger commercial jobs without forcing a swap-out mid-project. Dimensions: <strong>20 feet long, 8 feet wide, and 5 feet tall</strong>, open-top with a swing-door for walk-in loading. Twenty-five cubic yards holds roughly 7.5 full-size pickup truck loads of debris.</p>
          <p data-en="The 25-yard is where the math starts favoring larger sizes for active contractors. One 25-yard rental is cheaper than two 15-yard swap-outs, and the longer footprint means more efficient walk-in loading from a wider work zone. Most GCs, roofers, and additions specialists in the DMV default to either the 25 or the 30 for production work." data-es="El de 25 yardas es donde las cuentas empiezan a favorecer los tamaños más grandes para contratistas activos. Una renta de 25 yardas cuesta menos que dos cambios de 15 yardas, y el espacio más largo significa una carga a pie más eficiente desde una zona de trabajo más amplia. La mayoría de los contratistas generales, techadores y especialistas en ampliaciones del DMV eligen el de 25 o el de 30 para trabajo de producción.">The 25-yard is where the math starts favoring larger sizes for active contractors. One 25-yard rental is cheaper than two 15-yard swap-outs, and the longer footprint means more efficient walk-in loading from a wider work zone. Most GCs, roofers, and additions specialists in the DMV default to either the 25 or the 30 for production work.</p>

          <h3 data-en="Common 25-yard projects in the DMV" data-es="Proyectos comunes de 25 yardas en el DMV">Common 25-yard projects in the DMV</h3>
          <p data-en="After thousands of contractor drops across Prince George's County, Montgomery County, and northern DC, these are the projects that almost always land on the 25-yard:" data-es="Después de miles de entregas a contratistas en Prince George's County, Montgomery County y el norte de DC, estos son los proyectos que casi siempre terminan en el de 25 yardas:">After thousands of contractor drops across Prince George's County, Montgomery County, and northern DC, these are the projects that almost always land on the 25-yard:</p>
          <ul>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Home additions and major bump-outs.</strong> Demo from the existing exterior wall plus framing scraps, new construction debris, packaging, and offcuts. Single-story additions usually fit one 25-yard." data-es="<strong>Ampliaciones de casa y expansiones grandes.</strong> Demolición de la pared exterior existente más restos de estructura, escombros de construcción nueva, empaques y recortes. Las ampliaciones de un piso normalmente caben en un solo contenedor de 25 yardas."><strong>Home additions and major bump-outs.</strong> Demo from the existing exterior wall plus framing scraps, new construction debris, packaging, and offcuts. Single-story additions usually fit one 25-yard.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Whole-house gut renovations.</strong> Multi-room demo with cabinets, flooring, drywall, fixtures, plumbing rough-out, and old framing. Includes the kitchen and bath strip-outs at the same time." data-es="<strong>Renovaciones completas de casa.</strong> Demolición de varias habitaciones con gabinetes, pisos, paneles de yeso, accesorios, plomería y estructura vieja. Incluye las remociones de cocina y baño al mismo tiempo."><strong>Whole-house gut renovations.</strong> Multi-room demo with cabinets, flooring, drywall, fixtures, plumbing rough-out, and old framing. Includes the kitchen and bath strip-outs at the same time.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Large roofing tear-offs.</strong> Up to roughly 40 squares of asphalt shingles fits inside the 2-ton allowance; extra weight is billed at $105 per ton. Slate or concrete-tile roofs — call us first for tonnage." data-es="<strong>Remociones de techo grandes.</strong> Hasta aproximadamente 40 cuadros de tejas de asfalto caben dentro del límite de 2 toneladas; el peso adicional se cobra a $105 por tonelada. Techos de pizarra o teja de concreto — llámanos primero para el tonelaje."><strong>Large roofing tear-offs.</strong> Up to roughly 40 squares of asphalt shingles fits inside the 2-ton allowance; extra weight is billed at $105 per ton. Slate or concrete-tile roofs — call us first for tonnage.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Commercial office or retail cleanouts.</strong> Tenant turn-over for a 3,000–5,000 sq ft space — desks, partitions, drop ceilings, carpet, lighting." data-es="<strong>Limpiezas de oficina o comercio.</strong> Cambio de inquilino para un espacio de 3,000–5,000 pies cuadrados — escritorios, divisiones, cielos rasos, alfombra, iluminación."><strong>Commercial office or retail cleanouts.</strong> Tenant turn-over for a 3,000–5,000 sq ft space — desks, partitions, drop ceilings, carpet, lighting.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Light demolition projects.</strong> Garage teardown, detached shed removal, small outbuilding demo. Concrete priced separately." data-es="<strong>Proyectos de demolición ligera.</strong> Derribo de garaje, remoción de cobertizo independiente, demolición de construcción pequeña. El concreto se cotiza por separado."><strong>Light demolition projects.</strong> Garage teardown, detached shed removal, small outbuilding demo. Concrete priced separately.</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 data-en="How much weight can a 25-yard hold?" data-es="¿Cuánto peso aguanta un contenedor de 25 yardas?">How much weight can a 25-yard hold?</h3>
          <p data-html data-en="Every 25-yard rental includes a <strong>2-ton (4,000 lb) tonnage allowance</strong>, along with delivery, pickup, and a 14-day rental. Pricing is per material — priced to your material, so call or request a free quote — and any weight over the 2-ton allowance is billed at $105 per additional ton. That allowance covers most full-house remodels and large roofing jobs. For projects that include both heavy roofing and heavy framing demo, ask us — we may quote it as a heavy-debris job to estimate the tonnage up front." data-es="Cada renta de 25 yardas incluye un <strong>límite de tonelaje de 2 toneladas (4,000 lb)</strong>, junto con entrega, recogida y una renta de 14 días. El precio es por material — según tu material, así que llama o solicita una cotización gratis — y cualquier peso por encima del límite de 2 toneladas se cobra a $105 por tonelada adicional. Ese límite cubre la mayoría de las remodelaciones de casa completa y los trabajos de techo grandes. Para proyectos que incluyen tanto techo pesado como demolición de estructura pesada, pregúntanos — podemos cotizarlo como un trabajo de escombros pesados para estimar el tonelaje por adelantado.">Every 25-yard rental includes a <strong>2-ton (4,000 lb) tonnage allowance</strong>, along with delivery, pickup, and a 14-day rental. Pricing is per material — priced to your material, so call or request a free quote — and any weight over the 2-ton allowance is billed at $105 per additional ton. That allowance covers most full-house remodels and large roofing jobs. For projects that include both heavy roofing and heavy framing demo, ask us — we may quote it as a heavy-debris job to estimate the tonnage up front.</p>
          <p data-en="Pro tip for contractors: commercial accounts welcome — ask about billing and repeat-customer pricing for active accounts. Tell us your typical job mix and volume and we'll build a price sheet you can budget against. Reliable swap-outs on tight schedules is what we do for the DMV's largest remodelers." data-es="Consejo para contratistas: cuentas comerciales bienvenidas — pregunta sobre facturación y precios para clientes frecuentes en cuentas activas. Dinos tu mezcla típica de trabajos y volumen y armaremos una hoja de precios con la que puedas presupuestar. Cambios confiables en horarios apretados es lo que hacemos para los remodeladores más grandes del DMV.">Pro tip for contractors: commercial accounts welcome — ask about billing and repeat-customer pricing for active accounts. Tell us your typical job mix and volume and we'll build a price sheet you can budget against. Reliable swap-outs on tight schedules is what we do for the DMV's largest remodelers.</p>

          <h3 data-en="Where will the 25-yard fit on my property?" data-es="¿Dónde cabe el contenedor de 25 yardas en mi propiedad?">Where will the 25-yard fit on my property?</h3>
          <p data-en="The 25-yard needs space. At 20 feet long, it no longer fits in a typical residential single-car driveway:" data-es="El de 25 yardas necesita espacio. Con 20 pies de largo, ya no cabe en una entrada residencial típica de un auto:">The 25-yard needs space. At 20 feet long, it no longer fits in a typical residential single-car driveway:</p>
          <ul>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Long driveways (24+ ft).</strong> Most homes built after 1980 have enough length. Measure curb-to-garage before booking." data-es="<strong>Entradas largas (24+ pies).</strong> La mayoría de las casas construidas después de 1980 tienen suficiente largo. Mide de la acera al garaje antes de reservar."><strong>Long driveways (24+ ft).</strong> Most homes built after 1980 have enough length. Measure curb-to-garage before booking.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Active job sites.</strong> Where there's room for material flow and walk-in loading from the open door end." data-es="<strong>Sitios de trabajo activos.</strong> Donde hay espacio para el flujo de material y la carga a pie desde el extremo de la puerta abierta."><strong>Active job sites.</strong> Where there's room for material flow and walk-in loading from the open door end.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Commercial parking lots.</strong> Easy placement; just make sure the truck has swing room for drop and pull." data-es="<strong>Estacionamientos comerciales.</strong> Colocación fácil; solo asegúrate de que el camión tenga espacio para maniobrar al dejar y recoger."><strong>Commercial parking lots.</strong> Easy placement; just make sure the truck has swing room for drop and pull.</li>
            <li data-html data-en="<strong>Public street (with permit).</strong> Often required for tight urban lots. We pass permit fees through at cost." data-es="<strong>Calle pública (con permiso).</strong> A menudo requerido para lotes urbanos estrechos. Pasamos los costos del permiso a precio de costo."><strong>Public street (with permit).</strong> Often required for tight urban lots. We pass permit fees through at cost.</li>
          </ul>
          <p data-en="Not sure if a 25 fits? Send us a photo of your placement spot when you book. We'd rather catch a placement issue at the quote stage than at the curb." data-es="¿No estás seguro si el de 25 cabe? Envíanos una foto de tu lugar de colocación cuando reserves. Preferimos detectar un problema de colocación en la etapa de cotización que en la acera.">Not sure if a 25 fits? Send us a photo of your placement spot when you book. We'd rather catch a placement issue at the quote stage than at the curb.</p>
